DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20220828
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20220829
DTSTAMP:20260102T153337Z
UID:257jk5tnv6gf29gnls8ledreq1@google.com
CREATED:20220612T151736Z
DESCRIPTION:Al Bahr Shriner’s and “Rock-It Kids”\, (anorganization approved
  by Shriner’s International to promote Shriner’sInternational).&nbsp\; “Roc
 k-It Kids” is supportingtwo music concerts in the San Diego area this year.
 &nbsp\; The first will be on <b>August 28\, 2022 atPetco Park</b>.&nbsp\; “
 MötleyCrüe and Def Leppard” will be rocking the house at Petco.&nbsp\; Shri
 ners are being asked to volunteer theirtime to sell CD’s to the people atte
 nding the event.&nbsp\; For each CD sold by a Shriner\, family\,friends and
  other Masons\, a cash donation will be made to Shriner’s forChildren Hospi
 tals/Medical Centers through Shriners International.&nbsp\; This is a fanta
 stic way for Al Bahr Shrine tomake a donation to our Shriner’s for Children
  hospitals\, medical centers\, andclinics.&nbsp\; In addition to us being v
 isibleto the public (we are asked to wear our Fez’s\, Shrine shirts\, and a
 ny other Masoniclogo wear) the concert promoters will be featuring Shriners
  International inthree video presentations during the concert<b>. </b>For t
 he first time in San Diego\, Shriners and Masons will bespotlighted through
  a live rock concert.&nbsp\;What a great way to spend the evening.&nbsp\;Ou
 r volunteer work will help our children\, high-light Shriners and thework w
 e do\, let the public know who we are and how to become a Shriner. (Thiseve
 nt is also open to other Masonic Brothers and family who would like tohelp.
 )<b>&nbsp\;</b>We need up to 100 Shriner’s\, Masons\, family\, and friends 
 to helpwith sales of CD’s at this great event. &nbsp\;&nbsp\;We will be sta
 tioned at specific locationsand not walking the entire ball park.&nbsp\; <b
 >Ifyou are willing to be volunteer on August 28<sup>th</sup>\, please conta
 ct ChiefRabban Mike George (<a href="mailto:mgeorge2@san.rr.com">mgeorge2@s
 an.rr.com</a>\,&nbsp\; &nbsp\;Wor.Robert Weldon (<a href="mailto:rweldon@co
 x.net">rweldon@cox.net</a>\,&nbsp\; or Noble George Page (<a href="mailto:p
 agegeo@gmail.com)">pagegeo@gmail.com)</a></b> &nbsp\;&nbsp\;OnSeptember 25<
 sup>th</sup> there will be another concert featuring the groupJourney at Va
 lley View Center.&nbsp\; We willonly need about 5-10 Volunteers for that ni
 ght. PLEASE CONSIDER HELPING ONTHESE NIGHTS TO RAISE MONEY FOR SHRINER’S FO
 R CHILDREN AND SHRINER’SINTERNATIONAL.&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20220612T151736Z
LOCATION:Petco Park\, 100 Park Blvd\, San Diego\, CA 92101\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Concerts for Shriner's Children's
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
