DESCRIPTION:Hello Nobles\,\nWe have received a great offer from Der Wieners
 chneitzel\, thanks in great part to Noble Gene Yee\,  to have a "Fun Raiser
 " at their Chula Vista location on Third and Palomar (282 Palomar) on Thurs
 day\, June 28\, 2018 from 5:00  PM to 8:00 PM.  They will donate a percenta
 ge of their sales that day at that time to Al Bahr Shriners.  Please announ
 ce/bring your Blue Lodge Brothers and Sisters\, family\, friends\, and kids
 .  I would like to see a strong showing from our Units and Clubs (Clowns\, 
 Tin Lizzies\, etc) to take part in the festivities and show our colors!  Le
 t's all work together and make this "SHRINERSCHNEITZEL"  FUN RAISER a succe
 ss and  to continue to grow in the coming years. \nOscar\nOscar O. Cañedo\,
  Potentate
LAST-MODIFIED:20180525T180128Z
LOCATION:Wienerschnitzel\, 282 Palomar St\, Chula Vista\, CA 91911\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Al Bahr Wienerschneitzel Fundraiser
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
