DESCRIPTION:Event Title: Sacramento Hospital visit\n\nEvent Location: Shrin
 ers Hospital for Children in Sacramento\n\nDate(s): 8-24-18 through 8-26-18
 \n\nEvent Dress Code: Clown and casual\n\nEvent Add Information:\nThe Clown
 s are taking a trip to the Sacramento hospital to perform for the kids once
  again as we did two years ago.  This is something we are trying to do ever
 y two years to remind us that it is all about the kids in the end!  We leav
 e on a Friday - visit the hospital on a Saturday - and drive back late Satu
 rday or early Sunday.  We have already received permission from the Ben Ali
  Potentate\, the Ben Ali Clowns\, and from the hospital's Activities Coordi
 nator - Breanna Williams.\n\nPerforming for the children @ 2\;30 with a tou
 r following the event @ 3:30 on Saturday August 25th.
LAST-MODIFIED:20180705T211518Z
LOCATION:Shriners Hospitals for Children\, 2425 Stockton Blvd\, Sacramento\
 , CA 95817\, USA
