CREATED:20181125T222410Z
DESCRIPTION:Dress Code: Fez\, Black Suit and White Shirt and Tie.\nReminder
 : Passports or Sentri cards are required to reenter the United States.\n\nD
 ate Saturday January 26th\, 2019\nTime: 7PM\nLocation: En el Salon G. Auban
 el V. de la DLB.R.'.L.'.S.'. Ignacio Zaragoza No. 3 ubicado en Av. Revoluci
 on y Calle Novena\, Tijuana \n\nAl Bahr will try to take two vans down. The
 y will depart Al Bahr at 5PM and make one stop at the Chula Vista Chamber l
 ocation at Oscar’s mother-in-law’s house for South pick ups.\n\nWe will nee
 d two drivers for the Vans.\n\nIf you would like to ride in the vans please
  contact the office to make Van reservations by January 23rd at noon so we 
 have a count for the vans.\n\nDinner reservations can be made by sending an
  email note to the Mexican Club coordinator at manuel.lopez@shrinersbc.com\
 n\nCost is $10.00 per person.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190119T204958Z
LOCATION:En el Salon G. Aubanel V. de la DLB.R.'.L.'.S.'. Ignacio Zaragoza 
 No. 3 ubicado en Av. Revolucion y Calle Novena
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Installation of Officers Club Shriners Las Californias: Tijuana\, M
 exicali & Ensenada
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
