DESCRIPTION:Nobles Only\, \nLight refreshments will be available at 6:00pm 
 Meeting promptly at 6:30 pm\n\nThe Purpose of this meeting is to hear summa
 ry presentation of contract proposal for deferred maintenance\, upgrades an
 d necessary repairs of Al Bahr Shrine building and property to be presented
  by High Priest and Prophet Dave Murray. \n\n A motion will be presented to
  authorize the transfer of restricted funds from the Temple Property Accoun
 t not to exceed $725\,000 during Calendar years 2024 and 2025 to fund the d
 eferred maintenance\, upgrades and necessary repairs of Al Bahr Shrine buil
 ding and property.A 2024 dues card is required for admission.Fraternally\, 
 Anthony McLean PotentateAttest\,George P. PageRecorder
