UID:5cnhegiqcrnii7ima3p8n4h8qv@google.com
CREATED:20180407T003153Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAs your Club President I understand how important it is for C
 lub\nunity\, to get together and share our affection for our cars and to\na
 ssist fellow Club members in solving any automotive problems they\nmay be h
 aving. I am thereby establishing a monthly get together on\nthe second Satu
 rday of each month for breakfast in an informal\nsetting so we can familiar
 ize ourselves with fellow Club members and their cars.\n\nMark your calenda
 r now for Saturday\, April 14th \, as the first\nmonthly breakfast will be 
 held as a no host event at the Spice House\nCafe\, 9035 Clairemont Mesa Blv
 d.\, to start at 9 AM. It is just about\na mile from the Shrine Center\, ea
 st of I 15. The cafe is adjacent to\nthe Bank of America building on the so
 uth side of the street.\n\nBring your Lady and you antique or classic car a
 nd show the members\nwhat we have. There is plenty of parking so the rest o
 f the\ncustomers can also look and drool. You are more than welcome to\ninv
 ite any other Mason\, Shriner or friend who might have an interest in vinta
 ge cars.\n\nLooking forward to your attendance and a great exchange of idea
 s.\n\nBob Seybold\, President\n619/291-6082
LAST-MODIFIED:20181226T180331Z
LOCATION:Spice House Cafe\, 9035 Clairemont Mesa Blvd\, San Diego\, CA 9212
 3\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Antique & Classic Car Club Breakfast Cruise In
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
