DESCRIPTION:Event Title: Social dinner meeting with members of IASYC<br><br
 >Event Location: Southwestern Yacht Club on Qualitrough St.in Point Loma<br
 >Date(s): February 23\, 2022<br>Time(s): 5:30 PM - 8:30 PM<br>Event Dress C
 ode: Casual with fez<br>Divan Dress Code: <br>Event Add Information:<br>Din
 ner is a prime rib carving station plus buffet\, with wine and dessert cake
  for $33 per person.&lt\;br /&gt\;<br>&lt\;br /&gt\;<br>The meeting is desi
 gned as an event hosting the attendees at the midwinter meeting of the inte
 rnational Association of shrine yacht clubs. Approximately 32 to 35 attende
 es are expected\, with half coming from this mid winter meeting of the I AS
 YC\,\, and is a tables are arranged so that there can be good interaction b
 etween our members and the visitors.&lt\;br /&gt\;<br>&lt\;br /&gt\;<br>Thi
 s will indeed function as a regular monthly social meeting of the yacht clu
 b which would have ordinarily taken place on the third Thursday of the mont
 h\, February 19. This dinner meeting will replace this February 19 meeting 
 which was canceled..
LAST-MODIFIED:20220215T213751Z
LOCATION:Southwestern Yacht Club\, 2702 Qualtrough St\, San Diego\, CA 9210
 6\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yacht Club Dinner
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
